{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rollup/rollup/issues/164","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rollup/rollup","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rollup/rollup/issues/164/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rollup/rollup/issues/164/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rollup/rollup/issues/164/events","html_url":"https://github.com/rollup/rollup/issues/164","id":109757891,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxMDk3NTc4OTE=","number":164,"title":"Auto-indent changes multiline strings","user":{"login":"trbrc","id":1036770,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzY3NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1036770?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/trbrc","html_url":"https://github.com/trbrc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trbrc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trbrc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trbrc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trbrc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trbrc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trbrc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trbrc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trbrc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/trbrc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":211689302,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMTE2ODkzMDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rollup/rollup/labels/t%C2%B9%20%F0%9F%90%9E%20bug","name":"t¹ 🐞 bug","color":"F44336","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2015-10-05T09:16:22Z","updated_at":"2015-10-05T21:29:27Z","closed_at":"2015-10-05T16:01:29Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The auto-indent feature adds indentation to the contents of multiline strings.\n\n``` javascript\nexport const myTemplateString = `\nTemplate string content\n`;\n\nexport const myEscapedString = \"\\\nEscaped string content\\\n\";\n```\n\n`$ rollup -f iife -n strings strings.js`\n\n``` javascript\n(function (exports) { 'use strict';\n\n    const myTemplateString = `\n    Template string content\n    `;\n\n    const myEscapedString = \"\\\n    Escaped string content\\\n    \";\n\n    exports.myTemplateString = myTemplateString;\n    exports.myEscapedString = myEscapedString;\n\n})((this.strings = {}));\n```\n\nA workaround would be to use the `indent: false` option, but as far as I can tell that's not possible with the CLI. Since the defaults are `indent: true`, rollup is currently subtly breaking such code out of the box. A better solution would be to make the auto-indent feature treat these cases as an exception.\n\nI suggest that the output should be:\n\n``` javascript\n(function (exports) { 'use strict';\n\n    const myTemplateString = `\nTemplate string content\n`;\n\n    const myEscapedString = \"\\\nEscaped string content\\\n\";\n\n    exports.myTemplateString = myTemplateString;\n    exports.myEscapedString = myEscapedString;\n\n})((this.strings = {}));\n```\n","closed_by":{"login":"Rich-Harris","id":1162160,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjIxNjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1162160?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris","html_url":"https://github.com/Rich-Harris","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rollup/rollup/issues/164/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rollup/rollup/issues/164/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}